ode></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-div\"><a href=\"#val-div\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> div : <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>[&gt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-rem\"><a href=\"#val-rem\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> rem : <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>[&gt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-fmod\"><a href=\"#val-fmod\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> fmod : <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>[&gt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-fmod_of_rem\"><a href=\"#val-fmod_of_rem\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> fmod_of_rem : \u000A  <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>[&gt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>For <code>fmod_of_rem res x y</code>, given <code>res</code> is some representation of <code>rem x y</code>, returns <code>mod</code>. We receive <code>res</code> as a parameter, to allow optimisations where it is computed not through <code>rem</code> but through more optimal representation (e.g. using <code>fma</code>).</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-fma\"><a href=\"#val-fma\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> fma : \u000A  <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>[&gt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>fma x y z</code> is the exact result of <code>x * y + z</code>, rounded once to the destination precision (rather than with intermediate rounding).</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-min\"><a href=\"#val-min\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> min : <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>[&gt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The IEEE 754-2019 <code>min</code> and <code>max</code>: unlike <a href=\"#val-minimum\"><code>minimum</code></a> and <a href=\"#val-maximum\"><code>maximum</code></a>, a NaN is ignored, and <code>-0.0</code> is considered equal to <code>+0.0</code>. This is equivalent to:</p><pre class=\"language-ocaml\"><code>let min x y =\u000A  if is_nan x then y\u000A  else if is_nan y then x\u000A  else if lt x y then x\u000A  else if gt x y then y\u000A  else if is_negative x then x\u000A  else y</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-max\"><a href=\"#val-max\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> max : <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>[&gt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>IEEE 754-2019 <code>max</code>. See <a href=\"#val-min\"><code>min</code></a> for the differences with <a href=\"#val-maximum\"><code>maximum</code></a>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-minimum\"><a href=\"#val-minimum\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> minimum : <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>[&gt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The IEEE 754-2019 <code>minimum</code>: unlike <a href=\"#val-min\"><code>min</code></a> a NaN propagates, and <code>-0.0</code> is strictly below <code>+0.0</code>. This is equivalent to:</p><pre class=\"language-ocaml\"><code>let minimum x y =\u000A  if is_nan x || is_nan y then nan\u000A  else if lt x y then x\u000A  else if gt x y then y\u000A  else if is_negative x then x\u000A  else y</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-maximum\"><a href=\"#val-maximum\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> maximum : <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>[&gt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>IEEE-754-2019 <code>maximum</code>. See <a href=\"#val-minimum\"><code>minimum</code></a> for the differences with <a href=\"#val-max\"><code>max</code></a>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-abs\"><a href=\"#val-abs\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> abs : <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>[&gt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-neg\"><a href=\"#val-neg\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> neg : <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>[&gt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-sqrt\"><a href=\"#val-sqrt\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> sqrt : <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>[&gt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-is_normal\"><a href=\"#val-is_normal\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> is_normal : <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>[&gt; <a href=\"../index.html#type-sbool\">sbool</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-is_subnormal\"><a href=\"#val-is_subnormal\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> is_subnormal : <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>[&gt; <a href=\"../index.html#type-sbool\">sbool</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-is_zero\"><a href=\"#val-is_zero\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> is_zero : <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>[&gt; <a href=\"../index.html#type-sbool\">sbool</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-is_infinite\"><a href=\"#val-is_infinite\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> is_infinite : <span><span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"../T/index.html#type-sfloat\">T.sfloat</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>[&gt; <a href=\"../index.html#type-sbool\">sbool</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t<